  "worked_solution": "Consider a general vector $\\,[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}].$ Multiplying by the matrix $T,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 8 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-4x+8y \\\\ -3x+2y\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the linear transformation $\\,T\\,$ is given by\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\u27f6[\\begin{aligned}-4x+8y \\\\ -3x+2y\\end{aligned}].\n$$",
